# Bluetooth (track "bluetooth"): BlueZ (bluetoothd, bluetooth.service enabled by iso/build.sh) and the
# PipeWire Bluetooth audio plugin (A2DP / HFP headsets and speakers appear as normal sound devices).
# The session helper /usr/lib/aurora/helpers/aurora-bluetooth (pairing agent, discovery) needs python3-dbus + python3-gi.
# No root needed: bluez's D-Bus policy allows any local user; /dev/rfkill is tagged uaccess (70-uaccess.rules).
bluez
libspa-0.2-bluetooth
python3-dbus
python3-gi
rfkill
